[l_english.MODULE_TURRET_5A_TELEPORT]
Teleportation Strike

[l_english.MODULE_TURRET_5A_TELEPORT_desc]
Remember, teleportation has a cooldown period. When you pull the pin on a grenade, and then teleport the pin to enemy tank’s driver seat, there’s probably no way to save you.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_TURRET_5A_TELEPORT]
传送式打击

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_TURRET_5A_TELEPORT_desc]
请记住，传送术是有冷却时间的。当你拉开手榴弹拉环，然后将拉环传送到了敌军坦克驾驶室后，大概没有什么可以拯救你了。
